      "commitMessage": "fix(ci): restore full src/cmake/contracts trees from ci-r7-clean, preserve gen1 bytes_compacted fix\n\nroot_cause: main had two parallel histories; force-push ci-r7-clean then merge old-main created a third state that was missing ~300 source/cmake files present in ci-r7-clean but absent from old-main (482032605) — unsafe_stubs.cpp, jit_codegen_arith.cpp, sanitizers/*, etc\n\nfix_strategy: (1) git checkout origin/ci-r7-clean -- src/ cmake/ contracts/ to restore all missing files; (2) re-apply gen1 bytes_compacted bugfix that was overwritten by the src/ checkout\n\nregression_check: src/cmake/contracts now matches ci-r7-clean; gc-unit Configure CMake will find all source files; gen1 test fix and bytes_compacted fix preserved"
     },
