      "commitMessage": "fix A3+A6: ThrowIfNull return type, /wd4616, extern C SetExceptionMetadata\n\nA3: ThrowIfNull shape registry used 'void' return causing C2556/C2371\n    with AddExternalRuntimeStubs' CHAOS_IL2CPP_INTPTR decl. Changed to\n    CHAOS_IL2CPP_INTPTR + return 0.\nA3b: Added /wd4616 to suppress invalid pragma warning numbers in\n     generated code (2370/2371/2374 are not valid MSVC warnings).\nA6: ChaosReflectionSetExceptionMetadata_2params declaration was\n    missing extern \"C\" — C++ mangled name didn't match the C-linkage\n    definition in exception_api.cpp.\n\nAlso fixed CS8086 (unescaped } in interpolated string) in\nExceptionEmission.cs:3229.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
