      "date": "2026-06-09T16:27:47Z",
      "commitMessage": "fix: ContentsBuilder write bug in PipelineOrchestrator + AreEqual byte[] memcmp + crypto OpenSSL stubs\n\n- PipelineOrchestrator.cs: File.WriteAllText for NativeAotGeneratedSource\n  now uses ContentsBuilder?.ToString() ?? Contents when Contents is empty\n  (fixes 0-byte codegen output for large ObjectModelCode \u003e 200K chars)\n- RuntimeHelperShapeRegistry.cs: AreEqual by-ref value type (byte[]) now\n  generates std::memcmp structural comparison instead of pointer comparison\n- crypto_stubs.cpp: Full OpenSSL implementation for Linux with\n  alloc_byte_array/GcAllocateAtomic, EVP_Digest* hashes, HMAC_CTX* HMAC\n- crypto_stubs.h: Declare SHA1/256/384/512, SHA3-256/384/512, HMAC\n  family, MD5/HMACMD5, RNG (GetBytes/Fill) exported functions\n- TestProject.CMakeLists.txt.scriban: OpenSSL linkage for Linux\n- Regenerated codegen output for crypto + other chunks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
