      "date": "2026-05-26T14:30:20Z",
      "commitMessage": "fix: enum codegen disambiguation, hotpatch direct_ptr fallback, lazy young-gen init, pipeline profile\n\n- Codegen: enum AOT bake map key changed from IlOffset to (MethodId, IlOffset)\n  tuple to avoid conflicts across methods; BoxToString fold now handles both\n  ldsfld and ldc.i4+box patterns\n- hotpatch_dispatch: added entry.direct_ptr fallback when thunks==nullptr,\n  eliminating kDefaultArgThunks dependency across AOT/JIT modes\n- gc_region: lazy one-time InitYoungGeneration with CAS spin-lock for\n  benchmark/entry paths where RuntimeInit may not be called\n- runtime_init: explicit InitYoungGeneration/DestroyYoungGeneration in the\n  init/shutdown sequence\n- pipeline: dispatch generator unified to nullptr thunks + direct_ptr;\n  added warmup+PROFILE_RESET/PROFILE_DUMP; PROFILE stderr parsing in\n  benchmark stage; --native-config support (check/profile/ship)\n- profile.h: added CHAOS_IL2CPP_PROFILE_RESET macro\n- Foundation-dll report updates across all families\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
