      "date": "2026-05-25T00:06:22Z",
      "commitMessage": "feat: generic-supplement foundation-dll test family + SDK SHIP LTO + codegen fixes\n\n- Add GenericSupplement foundation-dll test family with handwritten NativeEntry,\n  managed subjects, and capability-family-contract.json\n- Fix compute_enum_hash24 namespace visibility by injecting using-declaration\n  after namespace close in generated enum metadata header\n- Fix extern \"C\" forward declaration generation to copy exact signatures from\n  page files instead of generic \"void func(...)\" declarations\n- Fix chaos_valuetype typedef ordering/visibility in generated module headers\n- Add assembly prefix to generated module struct names (option B) to avoid\n  naming collisions across assemblies\n- Extend foundation-dll pipeline (_replace_sdk_libs_for_ship) to swap SDK\n  static libs for SHIP build enabling cross-module LTO\n- Pipeline forward declaration and chaos_valuetype fix steps in\n  pipeline_native_aot_runner.py\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
