      "date": "2026-05-22T13:18:29Z",
      "commitMessage": "feat: hot-update integration tests — generics, VTable sync, benchmark, interpreter mixed execution\n\nAdd 4 new test suites for hot-update subsystem:\n\n- hotupdate_generics_test (9 tests): generic instantiation registration,\n  closed-type resolution, method generic context, duplicate detection\n- hotupdate_vtable_sync_test (5 tests): cross-module VTable slot update\n  across multiple registered TypeVTables, register/revert sync\n- hotupdate_replacement_benchmark_test (7 tests): Register/Revert latency\n  at varying scale, cycle stress, multi-threaded concurrent access\n- interpreter_mixed_execution_test (6 tests): InterpreterEntryDirect\n  dispatch through method_replacement thunks, args/ret/void/null paths\n\nAlso includes CMakeLists.txt wiring and prior in-progress GC test\nexpansions (gen1, BGC root scan, finalizer integration benchmarks).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
