     "partialFingerprints": {
      "commitSha": "cdc4daa8aeaade23021148c6d3af2f88eb500f78",
      "email": "maynardwolf27@gmail.com",
      "author": "PolarisWong",
      "date": "2026-05-17T08:44:35Z",
      "commitMessage": "VTable Phase 9b+: Interface offset cache (IOC) + runtime_iface_map + CallVirt TCVC integration\n\n- Add 32-entry thread-local IOC (Interface Offset Cache) in\n  chaos_find_interface_offset() for lock-free repeated interface offset lookups\n- Add runtime_iface_map + runtime_iface_count to TypeVTable struct for\n  hot-update interface additions\n- Implement RegisterTypeVTableRuntimeInterface() to dynamically append\n  interface mappings post-registration (bumps both g_iface_epoch and\n  g_vtable_epoch for TCVC/IOC invalidation)\n- Add ScanIfaceMapForMethod() shared helper for AOT and runtime iface_map scans\n- Update ResolveVirtualMethodPointer() to try runtime_iface_map after AOT\n  iface_map miss\n- Wire ChaosTypeAddInterface() to vtable_registry to sync MethodTable-level\n  runtime interfaces with TypeVTable-level registry\n- Add CastClass/IsInst runtime_iface_map scan in interpreter_vm.cpp\n- Fix: bump g_vtable_epoch in RegisterTypeVTableRuntimeInterface so TCVC\n  doesn't return stale nullptr after runtime interface registration\n- Add Test_ChaosFindInterfaceOffset and Test_HotUpdateVTableInterfaceResolution\n  integration tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
     "properties": {
      "tags": []
     }
