      "commitMessage": "Phase 0-3: Thread + Reflection CoreCLR alignment — MethodTable, EEClass, ThreadPool, Async\n\n- Phase 0: TypeHandle unification with MethodTable (64B, bit-compat with TypeInfoHot)\n- Phase 1: EEClass lazy fill + reflection de-stub (40+ stubs replaced)\n- Phase 2: AssemblyLoadContext isolation (kMaxAssemblies 64→256)\n- Phase 3: ThreadPool Hill-Climbing + IOCP + Thread.Abort via safepoint\n- ExecutionContext/AsyncLocal/CancellationToken/Task.Run runtime support\n- 200+ DLL capacity verified across all subsystems\n- Synchronization primitives: SemaphoreSlim, ReaderWriterLockSlim, Monitor/SyncBlock\n- WaitHandle: ManualResetEvent, AutoResetEvent, WaitAny/WaitAll\n- TimerQueue with gate thread integration\n- Wiki updated with complete thread architecture docs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
