      "date": "2026-05-04T06:28:47Z",
      "commitMessage": "Complete Hybrid TypeInfo* migration + native compilation fixes\n\n- Fix TypeInfo declaration order: topologically sort reference types so\n  parent TypeInfo instances (e.g. System.Object) are emitted before child\n  types, fixing undeclared identifier errors in reflection-binding\n- Add #pragma warning(disable: 4065 4244) to generated code, fixing\n  C4065 (empty switch) and C4244 (int conversion) warning-as-errors\n- Add 5 missing reflection function stubs: get_is_sealed,\n  get_is_generic_type_def, get_type_from_assembly_bool,\n  get_executing_assembly, get_assembly_location\n- Add TypeEntry tracking loop for reflection types used in scriban\n  templates (ReflectionGetObjectType, ReflectionCreateInstance, etc.)\n- Fix reflection_api.h get_parameter_name signature (2-param -\u003e 1-param)\n- Emit merge labels in structured control flow recovery for switches\n  and if/then/else to resolve label-undefined errors\n- 28/28 foundation-dll families compile successfully with MSVC\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
     "properties": {
      "tags": []
     }
