      "commitMessage": "Phase 2 Registry migration complete + foundation-dll expansion + runtime core modularization\n\n- Migrate all complex runtime helper shapes to GenericShapeDescriptor in Registry\n- Delete 16 dead TryCreate* methods (2600+ lines removed from StringAndPlatform + CollectionAndReflection)\n- Promote InlineBody entries to SimpleForward where applicable\n- Add runtime_helper_shapes.h generation for all foundation-dll families\n- Expand foundation-dll: threading-tasks-primitives, convert-char, delegate-core-invocation, reflection-member-basics\n- Modularize runtime-core headers (char_classification, marshal_abi, gc_helpers, etc.)\n- Add EnumOnly/ReadOnlySpan/stackalloc lowering support\n- Add build tooling (ai_codegen_reviewer, native_compile_runner, development tracking)\n- Wiki: ReferenceAssembly architecture, run-trace-viewer\n- Clean up abandoned/completed docs\n- Update governance tests for deleted methods\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
