      "date": "2026-04-29T00:54:02Z",
      "commitMessage": "Complete STL/system type encapsulation with CHAOS_IL2CPP_ macro abstraction\n\nConvert all bare \u003ccstdint\u003e types (int32_t, uint64_t, size_t, intptr_t, etc.)\nand std:: types (string, vector, mutex, thread, memcpy, etc.) across the\nentire codebase to CHAOS_IL2CPP_* macros defined in native_types.h.\n\nScope: src/native/* .h/.cpp, C# emission/planning, 109 Scriban templates,\n       build/ scripts, tests/ scripts, contracts/ and interpreter modules.\n\nExempted: C ABI contract headers (codegen_bridge.h, runtime_abi.h) that\n          must remain plain C-compatible types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e"
     },
